cff-version: 1.2.0
title: softpaws
message: If you use this software, please cite both the software and the method paper.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Stephan A.
    family-names: Meighen-Berger
    email: stephan.meighenberger@gmail.com
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6579-2000
repository-code: https://github.com/MeighenBergerS/softpaws
url: https://meighenbergers.github.io/softpaws/
abstract: >-
  A first-principles forward model for ultra-high-energy neutrino telescopes.
  softpaws solves high-energy muon transport analytically and builds detector
  effective areas, event rates and single-event energy reconstructions from
  that solution, for IceCube, KM3NeT/ARCA, P-ONE, TRIDENT and Baikal-GVD.
keywords:
  - neutrino
  - neutrino telescope
  - muon transport
  - effective area
  - astroparticle physics
